💰 1️⃣2️⃣ Work and Wages

Wages are proportional to work done.

\[
\boxed{
Wages\propto Work
}
\]

Suppose:

A and B work in efficiency ratio:

\[
2:3
\]

Total payment:

₹5000.

Total ratio:

\[
2+3=5
\]

A gets:

\[
\frac25\times5000
\]

\[
=\boxed{₹2000}
\]

B gets:

\[
\boxed{₹3000}
\]


