⚡ FAST MCQ TRICKS

🟢 If people work together:

\[
\boxed{\text{Add efficiencies}}
\]

🔴 If a pipe leaks/empties:

\[
\boxed{\text{Subtract efficiency}}
\]

🔄 Efficiency vs Time:

Efficiency ↑ → Time ↓
Efficiency ↓ → Time ↑

👷 Men-Days:

More workers → fewer days

🚰 Pipes:

Inlet → +
Outlet → -


---

🧠 FINAL FORMULA CARD

\[
\boxed{\text{1-day work}=\frac1n}
\]

\[
\boxed{\text{Work}=Rate\times Time}
\]

For two workers:

\[
\boxed{\text{Together time}=\frac{ab}{a+b}}
\]

Efficiency:

\[
\boxed{E\propto\frac1T}
\]

Same work:

\[
\boxed{Men\times Days=Constant}
\]

With hours:

\[
\boxed{Men\times Days\times Hours\times Efficiency}
\]

Pipes:

\[
\boxed{Net\ Rate=Inlets-Outlets}
\]


